{
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_find.txt/0": "嘿嘿……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/0": "呜哦………………\r\n啧！别得意忘形！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/1": "哦呵，真让人受不了……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/2": "哇？！丧、丧尸？\r\n快、快滚开！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/3": "你嘛………\r\n感觉像是个好人……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/4": "呵！一副热爱正义、疾恶如仇的样子，\r\n真让人恶心。\r\n滚吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/5": "哦，你是盗贼啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/6": "哦，你是海盗吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/7": "哦哦！你是刺客啊……\r\n没想到这职业还存在。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/8": "哦哦！你难道是那位\r\n康拉斯的黑暗骑士……？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/9": "喂，朋友……我这儿有\r\n效果超猛的好药……\r\n要不要？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/10": "哪怕是像你这样招人厌的家伙，\r\n也能让任何人都喜欢上你。\r\n毕竟，这可是超厉害的爱情药。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/11": "喝下去的瞬间，魅力会大幅提升。\r\n靠这份魅力，笼络人心也不在话下！\r\n喝了说不定就能找到旅伴哦！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/12": "我就偷偷告诉你吧，这药实在太强，\r\n据说所有国家都明令\r\n严禁使用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/13": "用了会构成\\c[52]重罪\\c[0]，\r\n不过嘛……只要走上整整4天，\r\n大家就会把那种事忘得一干二净，对吧？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/2079": "我想要！_(\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]/\\c[2]通缉度+8\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/2161": "\\c[4]那种危险药我才不要！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/14": "怎么样，要不要试试这瓶“魅力药”？\r\n只要这么一点，CHR就能提升\\c[52]3级\\c[0]，\r\n而且我看你顺眼，只要\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/15": "有兴趣吧？喝下这药\\c[52]会构成\r\n重罪\\c[0]，但只要靠这份魅力，\r\n在罪名消失前逃走就行了！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/2568": "我想要！_(\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]/\\c[2]通缉度+8\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/2644": "\\c[4]那种危险药我才不要！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/16": "只要这么一点就能提升魅力\r\n\\c[52]3级\\c[0]，今天仅需\r\n\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，不买可就是傻子了，对吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/17": "啧，这样啊。\r\n那就快滚吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/18": "多谢惠顾！\r\n来，一口气灌下去！别小口抿！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/19": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]喝光了\r\n魅力药！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/20": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的CHR提升了\\c[52]3级\\c[0]！\r\n通缉度升至\\c[2]$tmp2\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/21": "嗯——不错，你现在很有魅力。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/22": "那么，接下来就努力躲上四天吧！\r\n回见！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_471_dubious_medic_ev_talk.txt/23": "搞什么，你钱不够啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/0": "我们已经没什么可谈了。\r\n加油吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/1": "你这身打扮是怎么回事……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/2": "你是……\r\n看来不是术士啊……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/3": "你似乎很有\r\n理术才能。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/4": "既然你非要学，\r\n我也可以把我琢磨出的\r\n特殊理术知识教给你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/5": "又见面了。\r\n想学我的理术吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/6": "让我想想。现在能教你的有……",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/1191": "拜托了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/1222": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/7": "《\\c[52]噬兽焰\\c[0]》啊。\r\n我就用$tmp1拉比斯教你吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/8": "《\\c[52]噬翼焰\\c[0]》啊。\r\n我就用$tmp1拉比斯教你吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/9": "《\\c[52]噬龙焰\\c[0]》啊。\r\n我就用$tmp1拉比斯教你吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/10": "喂，你的钱不够……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/11": "开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/12": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]噬兽焰\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/13": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]噬翼焰\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/14": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]噬龙焰\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/15": "呼。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/16": "确实都教给你了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_472_hermit_ev_talk.txt/17": "这样啊…………\r\n不需要吗……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_find.txt/0": "呵呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/0": "那就加油吧……呵呵呵……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/1": "喂喂，这身打扮是怎么回事。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/2": "呵呵……你看起来很能打嘛。\r\n应该没有理由\r\n非得来招惹我吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/3": "你是\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]啊，呵呵！\r\n真不容易啊～。明明既没力量也没魔力，\r\n却还要踏上拯救世界的旅途？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/4": "不啦，抱歉抱歉。我很尊敬你。\r\n所以，我想教你一点\r\n“技能”。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/5": "怎么样？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/1125": "拜托了。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/1156": "暂时不用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/6": "这招会消耗大量ST，\r\n不过能原地不动，恢复一点HP。\r\n\\c[51]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/7": "呵呵呵……\r\n你的钱不够啊。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/8": "好，那就开始吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/9": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]隐遁\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/10": "好。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/11": "那么，就让世人见识一下\r\n弱者该怎么战斗吧。\r\n呵呵呵。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_473_powerless_ev_talk.txt/12": "呵呵！\r\n这样啊，那也没办法。\r\n我支持你。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "我是伊莎贝拉……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是伊莎贝拉……\r\n哎呀，你的身材真不错呢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "看来你……\r\n似乎用不了我的招式。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/433": "拜托了_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/487": "不要，太贵了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "那至少让我提升\r\n你们的士气吧，呵呵。\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，如何？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "呵呵，再见。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "哎呀，是你。\r\n我感觉到了与你相同的才能。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/946": "请教教我_\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/1026": "请提升士气_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/1099": "不用了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "如果你愿意，我可以把所知的人心笼络之法\r\n以\\c[52]$tmp2拉比斯\\c[0]教给你哦？\r\n还是让我提升同伴们的士气？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/1372": "请提升士气_\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/1440": "不用了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "咦，你已经拥有与我相同的力量了呢。\r\n那样的话，我就来\r\n提升同伴们的士气吧？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/8": "呵呵，再见。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/9": "呵呵……是啊。\r\n有缘的话，我们再见吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/10": "那么，开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/11": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]女王号令\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/12": "这种力量光是使用就相当耗费精力，\r\n所以建议你\r\n在重要时刻再用。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/13": "你没有钱吗。\r\n没想到像你这样有才华的人，\r\n也会为钱发愁。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/14": "那么……开始吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/15": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]\r\n一行人的士气提升了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/16": "呵呵，帮上忙了吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/17": "我明白了……那么……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/18": "……不过，\r\n你的钱不够呢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_talk.txt/19": "没想到像你这样有才华的人，\r\n也会为钱发愁。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_474_mystery_woman_ev_wanted.txt/0": "站住！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_find.txt/0": "哈呀啊啊啊",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/0": "哈呀啊啊——！！\r\n全速前进！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/1": "呃，还是把衣服……穿上吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/2": "喔————！！\r\n你能跟上我的速度吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/3": "喔————！！\r\n哦！你看起来也很敏捷嘛！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/4": "为什么我知道？\r\n因为我追求的就是最快速度！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/5": "不过，我比你更快！！\r\n想知道秘诀吗？\r\n没办法，我就教你吧！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/6": "怎么样，兄弟？",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/1105": "教教我！",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/1138": "还是算了",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/7": "《\\c[52]神速\\c[0]》不只消耗ST，连HP也会猛掉。\r\n奔跑期间毫无防备，但速度极快！\r\n\\c[52]$tmp1拉比斯\\c[0]，怎么样？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/8": "钱不够啊，喔喔喔喔！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/9": "好，那就开始吧！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/10": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]学会了\r\n\\c[52]神速\\c[0]！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/11": "这样一来，你也离\r\n最快更近一步了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_475_speedstar_ev_talk.txt/12": "你要走自己的路吗！\r\n我可不讨厌这样，耶！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/0": "什么？在炫耀吗？\r\n好啦好啦，真是漂亮！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/1": "呵呵……我是\r\n靠当佣兵谋生的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/2": "不过我现在正在休假。\r\n再见。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/510": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_不足\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/632": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/734": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/834": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/3": "就算这样向我炫耀，\r\n雇佣费也是不能打折的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/4": "……抱歉，我失态了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/5": "哇！好一个俊男！\r\n呃……抱歉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/6": "我靠当佣兵谋生。\r\n要不要雇用我？\r\n我不会让你吃亏的。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/7": "$tmp3拉比斯如何？只要你雇用我，\r\n我就会跟随你到旅程结束。\r\n山地等地形无法移动 \\c[52][协力NPC  需要CHR等级1 ]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/8": "很遗憾……看来你的钱不够。\r\n身为专业人士，\r\n这一点不能让。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/9": "如果还能再见，到时请务必\r\n带我一同旅行。\r\n那么…………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/10": "哎呀……这样吗。真遗憾。\r\n我明白了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/11": "如果还能再见，到时请务必\r\n带我一同旅行。\r\n那么…………。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/12": "抱歉……我还是觉得\r\n自己无法信任你。\r\n刚才的话，就当作没说过吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/13": "魅力不足……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/14": "太好了！真的吗！\r\n那么，请多关照。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_476_passion_soldier_woman_ev_talk.txt/15": "【好色的女剑士】\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/0": "唔………………\r\n别得意忘形！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/1": "什么嘛，是个男人啊。\r\n嗯？……是的，我是\r\n当佣兵的术士。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/2": "但我今天没兴致。\r\n告辞。",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/537": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[2]$tmp2_不足\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/660": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/763": "雇佣_\\c[52]$tmp3拉比斯\\c[0](CHR_\\c[52]$tmp1\\c[0]→\\c[3]$tmp2\\c[0])",
  "choice/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/864": "不用了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/3": "哎呀，这可真是美丽……噗！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/4": "…………竟然穿成这样……\r\n不，你一定有什么理由吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/5": "哦，真是位美丽的女士！\r\n很高兴见到您。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/6": "我是当佣兵的优秀术士！\r\n怎么样，要不要雇用我？\r\n我想我能帮上忙。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/7": "$tmp3拉比斯如何？只要你雇用我，\r\n我就会跟随你到旅程结束。\r\n山地等地形无法移动 \\c[52][协力NPC  需要CHR等级1 ]",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/8": "呃……很遗憾，\r\n你的钱似乎不够。\r\n我本想只要有这些也可以……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/9": "毕竟我也是专业人士……抱歉。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/10": "怎么会……这样吗。\r\n我明白了。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/11": "呃……我的直觉告诉我，\r\n不该跟着你。\r\n抱歉，刚才的话就当作没说过吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/12": "魅力不足……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/13": "交给我吧！\r\n我会保护你！！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_477_passion_soldier_man_ev_talk.txt/14": "【好色的男术士】\r\n开始跟随你了！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_483_ev_talk.txt/0": "啊………\r\n谢谢。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_483_ev_talk.txt/1": "虽然不多，\r\n请收下吧。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_483_ev_talk.txt/2": "如果我能逃出\r\n这片要塞地带，\r\n还会再给您更多谢礼……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_483_ev_talk.txt/3": "请……让我跟着您……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_483_ev_talk.txt/4": "凭我一个人，是不可能\r\n活着离开这里的……\r\n请帮帮我。",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_484_ev_find.txt/0": "需要陷阱吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_484_ev_talk.txt/0": "(你是弄掉装备了吗？)",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_484_ev_talk.txt/1": "需要陷阱吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_484_ev_talk.txt/2": "再来吧……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_484_ev_wanted.txt/0": "啧，正面战斗\r\n可不是我的强项……",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_485_ev_find.txt/0": "要买点什么吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_485_ev_talk.txt/0": "你……裸、裸体？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_485_ev_talk.txt/1": "我是天空的商人。\r\n需要传送药水吗？",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_485_ev_talk.txt/2": "谢谢！",
  "message/data/event/object/udb22_485_ev_wanted.txt/0": "这个人……\r\n在通缉令上……"
}
